OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening to come, although the
OL,7,Fodd shower cannot be entirely ruled
OL,8,Fout. Cloud increases from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest later with the odd spot of
OL,10,Frain possible. Another mild night with
OL,11,Flight winds throughout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA cloudy Monday with isolated
OL,14,Fspots of light patchy rain possible.
OL,15,FTurning drier later. Still very warm,
OL,16,Fthough not feeling as hot as recent
OL,17,Fdays.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
