OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fon Tuesday with some light rain.
OL,7,FLikely turning drier on Wednesday
OL,8,Fbefore further showers on Thursday.
OL,9,FTemperatures gradually returning to
OL,10,Faverage.
